    "title": "Tech company LITEON brings headquarters to McKinney - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KERA ,\n11 hours ago LITEON, a Taiwanese based technology company, will establish their North American headquarters in McKinney. The $919 million investment is said to establish more than 600 new jobs in Collin County, and represents one of the largest investments in the city's history. McKinney's Mayor Bill Cox joined NTX Now's Ron Corning... Read full article\n1",
